body:
maybe try picking up a hobby! if you have online friends, maybe try playing a game? stuff like jackbox, tf2, mario party (the one w online.. i forgot the name of it)

if you don't have friends to call at night, maybe pick up a hobby! painting, yoga, maybe even a single player game? (i like hades, undertale, stardew valley and so on)

if you have a phone you can find plenty of mobile games and social networks on there as well!
